  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kenya Research and Development Synergy Initiative</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project seeks to catalyze the development of a cohesive, collaborative, and globally competitive R&amp;D ecosystem in Kenya that effectively drives innovation and sustainable national development through the the creation of a coordination mechanism to sustain alignment and shared purpose, and a dynamic digital platform that will function as the ecosystem&#x2019;s central nervous system - integrating data, enabling knowledge exchange, and informing policy decisions.</narrative>
  </description>
